#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:2 e52166d86ae34e848cd9d58bcfd997a0
msgid "AsyncHyperliquid"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:6 961015f09d9d4830946171c3dbea7431
msgid ""
"This reference includes methods that place, modify, cancel, and close "
"orders; change leverage or margin; and move assets. A signature is not a "
"safety procedure. Before calling them, read :doc:`../howto/orders`, "
":doc:`../howto/routing`, :doc:`../howto/transfers-administration`, and "
":doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation`. Start on testnet and reconcile "
"every ambiguous signed outcome before replacement."
msgstr ""
"本参考包含下单、修改、取消和关闭订单，更改杠杆或保证金，以及转移资产的方法。签名并非安全流程。"
"调用这些方法前，请阅读 :doc:`../howto/orders`、:doc:`../howto/routing`、"
":doc:`../howto/transfers-administration` 和 :doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation`。"
"请从 testnet 开始，并在替换前对每个含糊的已签名结果进行对账。"

#: 93b5ff567e0c48df8f0b681ae1229a40 async_hyperliquid.client.AsyncHyperliquid:1
#: of
msgid "Resource owner plus intent-level order workflows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:17 77a68681846245adb56dc82b5613a6c8
msgid ""
"Use the root client for workflows that resolve coins, metadata, prices, "
"token precision, or positions. Use ``.info`` for reads and ``.exchange`` "
"for the Info-independent actions listed in :doc:`exchange-client`."
msgstr ""
"对于需要解析币种、元数据、价格、token 精度或持仓的工作流，请使用 root client。"
"使用 ``.info`` 进行读取，使用 ``.exchange`` 执行 :doc:`exchange-client` 中列出的独立于 Info 的操作。"
